  "content_html": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/assets/images/content/2cae3e780b0b05b696.png\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img alt=\"חייל עב-כרס נרדם בשלווה בשדה הקרב\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"471\" data-original-width=\"468\" height=\"320\" src=\"/assets/images/content/2cae3e780b0b05b696.png\" width=\"318\" /></a></div><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: large;\">מה מלמדת אותנו פרשת מסעי על אחריות, ירושה ומאבקי הדור הזה?</span></span></h2><p></p><blockquote style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וְאִם לֹא תוֹרִישׁוּ אֶת יֹשְׁבֵי הָאָרֶץ מִפְּנֵיכֶם וְהָיָה אֲשֶׁר תּוֹתִירוּ מֵהֶם לְשִׂכִּים בְּעֵינֵיכֶם וְלִצְנִינִם בְּצִדֵּיכֶם</span></blockquote><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">וְאִם לֹא תּוֹרִישׁוּ,</span></span></p><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height: 1.6667; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 9pt;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וְעַל אַכְזָר יַחֲמֹל לִבְּכֶם.</span></span></p><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height: 1.6667; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 9pt;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וְאִם לֹא תָּנִיסוּ,</span></span></p><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height: 1.6667; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 9pt;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וְהוֹתַרְתֶּם מֵהֶם.</span></span></p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height: 1.6667; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 9pt;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אֲשֶׁר דִּמִּיתִי לַעֲשׂוֹת,</span></span></p><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height: 1.6667; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 9pt;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לָהֶם, אֶעֱשֶׂה לָכֶם.</span></span></p><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height: 1.6667; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 9pt;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וְאֶת הָאָרֶץ הַזֹּאת,</span></span></p><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height: 1.6667; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 9pt;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">יִרְשׁוּ תַּחְתֵּיכֶם.</span></span></p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height: 1.6667; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 9pt;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אִם תִּהְיוּ יְפֵי נֶפֶשׁ,</span></span></p><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height: 1.6667; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 9pt;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וּתְדַבְּרוּ פּוֹלִיטִיקְלִי קוֹרֵקְט.</span></span></p><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height: 1.6667; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 9pt;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">סוֹפְכֶם לִשְׁכַּב בָּרֶפֶשׁ,</span></span></p><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height: 1.6667; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 9pt;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מִפְּנֵי טִיל קוֹרְנֵט.</span></span></p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height: 1.6667; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 9pt;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אִם תִּנְעַמְנָה הַמַּחְמָאוֹת,</span></span></p><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height: 1.6667; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 9pt;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אִם אוֹתָן תֵּלְכוּ לְקוֹשֵׁשׁ.</span></span></p><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height: 1.6667; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 9pt;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אִם תִּמָּנְעוּ מִמִּלְחָמוֹת,</span></span></p><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height: 1.6667; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 9pt;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">יִהְיֶה זֶה אַךְ מוֹקֵשׁ.</span></span></p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height: 1.6667; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 9pt;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אִם יְבַקֵּשׁ אַלּוּף לָנוּחַ,</span></span></p><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height: 1.6667; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 9pt;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לִשְׁכַּב עַל זֵר דַּפְנָה.</span></span></p><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height: 1.6667; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 9pt;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לְהִתְמַכֵּר לָרוּחַ,</span></span></p><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height: 1.6667; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 9pt;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לְבַכֵּר סִפְרָא עַל סַייפָא.</span></span></p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height: 1.6667; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 9pt;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אִם יֹאכַל וְיִשְׁתֶּה,</span></span></p><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height: 1.6667; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 9pt;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וְסַנְטֵרוֹ יַעֲלֶה פִּימוֹת.</span></span></p><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height: 1.6667; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 9pt;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">בְּיוֹם פְּקֻדָּה יִשְׁאֶה,</span></span></p><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height: 1.6667; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 9pt;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">כְּאִישׁ חֲלוֹמוֹת.</span></span></p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height: 1.6667; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 9pt;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אַכְזָר הוּא אוֹיְבֵיכֶם,</span></span></p><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height: 1.6667; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 9pt;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">עַל זָקֵן לֹא יַחֲמֹל.</span></span></p><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height: 1.6667; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 9pt;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">זֶה הוּא אוֹ אַתֶּם,</span></span></p><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height: 1.6667; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 9pt;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הַיּוֹם, מָחָר, אֶתְמוֹל.</span></span></p>"
}
